<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears Kredyt Bank share issue.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears Kredyt Bank share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared 5.6 million shares in Kredyt Bank SA for main market trade on the Warsaw bourse from September 16, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The shares, which were cleared for trade by the bourse last month, are from a February public offering in which the Belgian Kredietbank took up 1.4 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
